abstract: >-
  This report analyzes how DeepSeek V4 (Flash-0731 / Pro-0813) loses
  capability under real agentic conditions and how the J-Space Cognition
  Suite reduces capability-realization loss. It documents benchmark evidence,
  the chain-of-thought diode analysis, and engineering conclusions. The report
  is licensed under CC BY-ND 4.0: share and cite with attribution; do not
  modify or distribute derivative works.
